The overlay port in libjpeg-turbo/ is a modified copy of the libjpeg-turbo port of vcpkg
(https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg, ports/libjpeg-turbo at commit
65514b43a035548911e1789071785a9827470cdc). Changed by ddb-tilers: portfile.cmake builds the
SIMD code on every x86 / x64 target and requires NASM (the comment in portfile.cmake says why).
The patches are those of the vcpkg port. (This notice sits outside the port folder: vcpkg hashes
every file of a port into its ABI key.)

